          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "विसर्जयति (visarjayati) is built from vi and the causative of the root √sṛj, \"to let go, send forth\"; MW gives vi-sṛj as to send or pour forth, let go, and the immersion of an image is its festival use (MW)."
            }
